                            	  3877:     ; Animation frame 1 uses Wallmaster frame image 1, which
                            	  3878:     ; uses tiles $9C/$9D on the left and $9E/$9F on the right.
                            	  3879:     ; The right side is correctly the right side of a closed hand.
                            	  3880:     ; But the left side is Keese. So, we have to patch the left
                            	  3881:     ; side to use the common left side of the hand -- $AC/$AD.
                            	  3882:     ;
                            	  3883:     ; Keep in mind that left and right sprites might be flipped.
                            	  3884:     ;
